                            <comment id="14607754" author="akfp" created="Tue, 30 Jun 2015 07:21:55 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;This is a serious issue, because Zeppelin has other synchronization bugs that keep paragraphs &quot;pending&quot; in error.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Thus it is important that when resetting the interpreter, the paragraph state is cleaned as well.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
